{"updated":"2026-11-22T13:02:13.188Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"Df_3KM2E6kw","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df_3KM2E6kw","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"最近使用了Gemini新出的模型\nGemini Neon真的很不錯\n可愛龍不是可愛龍了\nGemini黑色星期五有半價優惠喔\n有興趣的可以訂閱起來到11/26","timestamp":"2026-11-21T09:02:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df_3KIBE4FA","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df_3KIBE4FA","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"x.com/vikas…\none.google.com/intl…","timestamp":"2026-11-21T09:02:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df_EzLljgnW","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df_EzLljgnW","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Three.js 做遊戲，場景一定要靠程式碼一個物件一個物件擺嗎？\n\nThree Studio 把這段做成了桌面編輯器：拖模型進場景、擺燈光和碰撞區，掛上 TypeScript 互動，按 Play 就能在同一個視窗測。做完還能匯出靜態網頁，讓別人用瀏覽器玩。\n\n如果你想做「走到門前，按一下就開門」的小關卡，這個 repo 值得拆：場景負責擺門，碰撞區決定何時能互動，程式負責門怎麼動。不用把三件事都寫死在同一個檔案裡。\n\nMIT 開源，目前是概念驗證，安裝檔未簽署。我會先拿來做原型，不急著把整款遊戲搬過去。\n\nGitHub：github.com/three…","timestamp":"2026-11-21T01:42:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df9ZOI1ipF7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df9ZOI1ipF7","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"AI 回了合法的 JSON，客服工單還是可能分錯。\n\n今晚花 5 分鐘，不用裝工具。假設工單是「所有使用者都無法登入」，優先級只接受 high 或 normal，這題應該是 high。\n\n試著判這四個輸出：\n① {\"priority\":\"high\"}\n② 結果如下：{\"priority\":\"high\"}\n③ {\"priority\":\"urgent\"}\n④ {\"priority\":\"normal\"}\n\n依序查：整段能解析嗎？值在允許範圍嗎？分級合理嗎？②、③、④ 各錯在不同關。\n\nPromptfoo 官方指南有自動化測法：\npromptfoo.dev/docs…","timestamp":"2026-11-20T10:02:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df9U4dpk5Ta","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df9U4dpk5Ta","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"考過AI應用規劃師了！\n幾乎沒怎麼準備（算是低分飛過\n這次根本是考國文程度\n題目都超級長\n本來以為不會過了\n居然過了\n證照+1\n#IPAS #AI","timestamp":"2026-11-20T09:24:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DgCwWBUDXUU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCwWBUDXUU","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"我想知道\n到底有多少人會瞞著家人偷偷出國？\n\n說真的 如果是背包客\n現在到日本的時間和金錢成本\n其實跟去南部差不多了\n但每次跟家人說要出國 家人就一直唸\n說我今年去了兩次日本了\n錢花太兇 怎麼都不跟他去之類的\n有嘗試溝通過但還是沒用\n導致我有想自己偷偷出去的念頭\n跟家人說我去南部玩\n(以前就常跟朋友去南部玩 所以可以很自然)\n實際上跑到日本\n因為有些行程我不希望家人介入\n只想要自己走\n\n大家覺得這要如何解決呢⁉️","timestamp":"2026-11-22T12:00:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCwXjRjTVe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCwXjRjTVe","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B3：我不住家裡\n平常家人不會聯絡\n根本不知道我去哪","timestamp":"2026-11-22T12:00:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCwYjEjTDm","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCwYjEjTDm","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B9：下個月要偷偷去紐約\n還在擔心時差會不會被發現🫠","timestamp":"2026-11-22T12:00:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCwZeljTvO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCwZeljTvO","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨瞞著家人偷偷出國✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多出國的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-22T12:00:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCpfQSDuMI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCpfQSDuMI","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"這題怎解⁉️在線急‼️\n\n前陣子男友生日與他的朋友一起去夜唱\n我身體不適 在家沒一起去\n\n今天在使用男友手機時\n剛好跳出男友好友的訊息\n因好奇心驅使，於是我點進去看後發現\n那天夜唱完男友載一個女生回家沒告訴我\n並且男友與男友好友的對話如下\n🤥男友 🫥男友好友\n🤥：剛剛差點把持不住\n🫥：你直接載她回家 沒去別的地方喔\n🤥：我下次就跟她一起回去 以前沒發現她是潛力股 越看越不錯\n🫥：你一起去的話 她也不會說什麼\n\n後來當然是與男友大吵一架\n他說是男生之間的屁話\n雖然男友確實沒做出對不起我的事且道歉認錯\n但我還是想問問，男生之間的屁話真的會拿女生朋友來講嗎？","timestamp":"2026-11-22T11:00:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":7,"reposts":0,"shares":6},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCpggLDlA_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCpggLDlA_","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B8：負責任的告訴你 不是玩笑話","timestamp":"2026-11-22T11:00:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCphk-DoTf","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCphk-DoTf","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B23：光是載女生不報備就知道他的心思了","timestamp":"2026-11-22T11:00:38.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCpiiAjvBI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCpiiAjvBI","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B9：如果是我，我不能接受\n你管他是不是真的屁話","timestamp":"2026-11-22T11:00:46.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCim2TiZ-3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DgCim2TiZ-3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"防彈V被嚇到的時候⋯⋯\n\n大眼睛會變得更大\n嘴巴也會\"嗚哇\"\n像漫畫人物一樣ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ\n超級可愛ㅋㅋㅋㅋ\n\n（按讚有驚喜嘻嘻嘻嘻）","timestamp":"2026-11-22T10:00:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":30,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":40,"first_seen":"2026-11-23T01:42:09+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DgCioKzCcwK","url":"